T-108-navigation-wrap-fix — 2026-09-11
Nguon: nguoi dung bao cao chi tiet loi header — "Danh muc" nhay len hang tren, TRANG CHU/DIEU
TRI/MUA SAM roi xuong hang duoi, mat can doi align-items, nut < > chen ngang giua chu.

DIEU TRA THAT (khong doan mo hinh loi, do dac qua Playwright o 6 do rong: 992/1024/1100/1200/
1280/1440/1536/1920):
- boundingClientRect cua .sudes-cate-header (Danh muc) va .sudes-main-header (nav) cho thay
  mainY = cateY + ~42px o TAT CA cac do rong duoc test TRUOC khi sua - tuc la loi nay xay ra o
  MOI do rong desktop, khong phai 1 khoang hep rieng le nhu bao cao ban dau co the goi y.

ROOT CAUSE CHINH XAC: .navigation-horizontal > .row (assets/global_core.scss.bwt) la Bootstrap
.row MAC DINH flex-wrap:WRAP (khong phai nowrap). Thuat toan flexbox quyet dinh wrap DUA TREN
kich thuoc NOI DUNG CHUA CO (flex-basis:auto) cua .sudes-main-header - nav 6 muc tieng Viet dai
(uoc tinh >1000px neu khong bi co) LUON vuot qua cho con lai ben canh "Danh muc" (152px min-
width), nen hang LUON wrap .sudes-main-header xuong dong 2 - BAT KE .sudes-main-header da duoc
dat min-width:0 + flex-shrink:1 tu T-104 (cac thuoc tinh nay chi cho phep co KHI DA o cung 1
dong, KHONG ngan duoc quyet dinh wrap o cap container flex-wrap).

Day la 1 gap ky thuat that trong logic T-104 (bo sot flex-wrap:nowrap khi merge .header-menu vao
box-hearder) - khong phai gia dinh sai, ma la 1 thuoc tinh CSS quan trong bi bo sot khi lam T-104,
chi lo ra khi test THAT nhieu do rong (T-104 chi test 1280/1440/992/mobile, khong du rong de bat
duoc pattern nay ro rang - o may do rong do wrap van xay ra nhung it ro rang hon).

FIX: them "flex-wrap: nowrap" cho .header-menu .navigation-horizontal > .row (1 thuoc tinh CSS,
scoped dung vao ngu canh box-hearder da merge). Ep 2 cot (Danh muc + nav) LUON cung 1 dong, de co
che co dan (min-width:0/flex-shrink) + cuon ngang co san (.navigation-horizontal.overflow +
#prev/#next, da sua T-103) xu ly phan du dung nhu thiet ke ban dau.

VERIFY (E2 — Playwright that, do dac + tuong tac that, KHONG chi nhin anh):
1. Do lai boundingClientRect cua ca 2 cot o 9 do rong (992-1920px): cateY va mainY LECH <5px o
   MOI do rong - xac nhan cung 1 dong, khong con wrap.
